    ⚡ HOW THE PROGRAM WORKS:
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    
    🔹 CORE TECHNOLOGY
    ManageEngine Desktop Central operates through an agent-based architecture where a lightweight client is deployed to each managed device, communicating securely with a central server. The server console provides real-time visibility and control over your entire IT infrastructure. The software automates routine IT tasks through policy-based management, allowing administrators to define configurations once and apply them across thousands of endpoints. It supports both Windows, Mac, and Linux systems, as well as mobile devices running iOS, Android, and Windows Phone .
    
    🔹 KEY FEATURES
    Desktop Central includes comprehensive endpoint management capabilities:

    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    📦 SOFTWARE DEPLOYMENT    │ Install apps remotely to any device
    🔧 PATCH MANAGEMENT       │ Automate Windows and third-party patches
    💻 OS DEPLOYMENT          │ Network-based Windows/Mac/Linux installation
    🔍 ASSET MANAGEMENT       │ Complete hardware and software inventory
    🖥️ REMOTE CONTROL         │ Troubleshoot desktops from anywhere
    📱 MDM                    │ Mobile device management for iOS/Android
    🔒 SECURITY CONFIG        │ Enforce security policies across endpoints
    📊 POWER MANAGEMENT       │ Configure energy-saving settings
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    
    🔹 SOFTWARE MANAGEMENT

    📦 APPLICATION DEPLOYMENT
    • PACKAGE CREATION: MSI, EXE, script-based installers
    • SCHEDULED DEPLOYMENT: Set maintenance windows
    • TARGETED INSTALLATION: Deploy to specific users/groups
    • SELF-SERVICE PORTAL: Allow users to install approved software
    • LICENSE MONITORING: Track software license compliance
    • UNINSTALL REMOTE: Remove unwanted applications
    
    🔹 PATCH MANAGEMENT

    🔧 AUTOMATED UPDATES
    • WINDOWS UPDATES: All Microsoft patches
    • THIRD-PARTY: 250+ applications (Adobe, Java, Chrome, etc.)
    • CUSTOM PATCHES: Deploy your own updates
    • PRE-DEPLOYMENT TESTING: Test patches on pilot groups
    • ROLLBACK SUPPORT: Revert problematic updates
    • PATCH COMPLIANCE: Detailed compliance reporting
    
    🔹 OS DEPLOYMENT

    💻 SYSTEM IMAGING
    • NETWORK BOOT: PXE-based deployment
    • IMAGE CAPTURE: Create custom OS images
    • MIGRATION TOOLS: User profile migration
    • DRIVER INJECTION: Automatic driver detection
    • POST-DEPLOYMENT TASKS: Join domain, install software
    • SUPPORTED OS: Windows 10/11, Server, Mac, Linux
    
    🔹 ASSET MANAGEMENT

    🔍 INVENTORY TRACKING
